WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
- I was talking about like

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.714
some of my favorite
moments from Charlie's,

00:00:02.714 --> 00:00:04.960
boarding Lucy's plane to Tokyo

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.793
with Tom Green in toe.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.343
You duct taping up the
girls in the racing suit.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.230
I love when you were the, you know,

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:16.420
what do you guys like?

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.160
What's, what is one of
your favorite memories?

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.860
- Well, some of it's not on film.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.120
- Yeah.
- For me it was like,

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.610
I had joined you guys.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:26.360
You were already in training

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.060
and you know,

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.300
you guys were so welcoming.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.167
I came in, you guys gave me huge hugs

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:33.790
and then we started training

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:34.750
and you're like, you're doing so great,

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:35.583
you're doing so great

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:37.533
and I felt like I'm doing really great.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:38.390
(laughing)

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.230
And then the next day I could not move.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.266
I was immobilized.

00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:44.099
(laughing)

00:00:44.099 --> 00:00:45.460
I was so flexible the first day

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.560
and then I literally, I
couldn't even bend over.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.810
I was like, I'm in so much pain.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:50.330
And then we used to do acupuncture

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.590
and I mean, it was a matter of survival

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:54.740
just getting through
that training session.

